    {
      "id": "n34",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8.0,
      "y": 3120.0,
      "width": 565.44,
      "height": 240.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "Pnotes"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1007156562,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 450889026,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "proposed changes, none of this is in the keymap yet\n\npos 0    `  \u2192  esc                 (backtick moves to the inner key)\npos 11   drop the del hold, plain bksp\npos 42   hold hyper, tap `  (shift gives ~ for free, no mod-morph)\npos 43   hold meh,   tap esc\npos 51   hold lower, tap del\npos 52   hold raise, tap tab            (esc moves to 43)\npos 53   stays bare cmd   \u2014 a mod-tap here misfires on every aborted cmd-tab\npos 54   stays bare space \u2014 a hold-tap here delays the most frequent key\npos 55   hold flips lower \u2192 raise, tap enter\npos 56   hold lower, tap sticky shift    (needs a new lt_sticky hold-tap)\npos 57   tap bksp, shift+tap del         (needs a mod-morph)\n\nlower now sits on 51 + 56 and raise on 52 + 55, so either hand reaches\neither layer and adjust becomes an adjacent two-key roll on one thumb.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "proposed changes, none of this is in the keymap yet\n\npos 0    `  \u2192  esc                 (backtick moves to the inner key)\npos 11   drop the del hold, plain bksp\npos 42   hold hyper, tap `  (shift gives ~ for free, no mod-morph)\npos 43   hold meh,   tap esc\npos 51   hold lower, tap del\npos 52   hold raise, tap tab            (esc moves to 43)\npos 53   stays bare cmd   \u2014 a mod-tap here misfires on every aborted cmd-tab\npos 54   stays bare space \u2014 a hold-tap here delays the most frequent key\npos 55   hold flips lower \u2192 raise, tap enter\npos 56   hold lower, tap sticky shift    (needs a new lt_sticky hold-tap)\npos 57   tap bksp, shift+tap del         (needs a mod-morph)\n\nlower now sits on 51 + 56 and raise on 52 + 55, so either hand reaches\neither layer and adjust becomes an adjacent two-key roll on one thumb.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10
    },
